flowchart TB
    subgraph A["A. Verified Existing Architecture Baseline"]
        direction TB
        ActivityA[TaskDetailsActivity] -->|Sends user actions| VMA[TaskViewModel]
        VMA -->|Exposes allTasks and filteredTasks StateFlow| ActivityA
        VMA -->|Requests task data| RepoA[TaskRepository]
        RepoA -->|Queries DAO| DaoA[TaskDao]
        DaoA -->|Queries DB| DBA[AppDatabase]
        DBA -->|Room records| DaoA
        DaoA -->|Flow list of TaskEntity| RepoA
        RepoA -->|Returns Flow/result| VMA

        NoteA1[TaskEntity has id, title, isCompleted, priority]
        NoteA2[TaskDao supports retrieval Flow, insert, update completion, delete]
    end

    subgraph B["B. Proposed API Retrieval Architecture (Unimplemented / PENDING)"]
        direction TB
        ActivityB[TaskDetailsActivity] -->|Sends user actions| VMB[TaskViewModel]
        VMB -->|Requests task retrieval| RepoB[TaskRepository]

        RepoB -.->|Proposed request through client| Client[TaskApiClient]
        Client -.->|Proposed GET /api/v1/tasks| API[Mock REST API]
        API -.->|Proposed JSON response| Client
        Client -.->|Proposed response body| DTO[ApiTaskDto]
        DTO -.->|DTO supplied for conversion| Mapper[ApiTaskMapper]
        Mapper -.->|Mapped application model| RepoB
        RepoB -.->|Proposed result exposed to ViewModel| VMB
        VMB -.->|Proposed UI state through StateFlow| ActivityB

        RepoB -->|Existing local data operations| DaoB[TaskDao]
        DaoB -->|Existing database access| DBB[AppDatabase]
        DBB -->|Stored Room records| DaoB
        DaoB -->|Existing Room Flow| RepoB

        NoteB1[API result persistence, Room/API merge or replacement, ID mapping and synchronization are PENDING - TRAINER APPROVAL]
        NoteB2[TaskApiClient, DTO, Mapper and remote connections are proposed, not implemented]
    end
